{"id":"c2f8e5f44929f679","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences.md","title":"Pi-One-One Comprehension and Tree Path Index Sets","display":"thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences — Pi-One-One Comprehension and Tree Path Index Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences","aliases":["62-thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences"],"display":"thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences — Pi-One-One Comprehension and Tree Path Index Sets","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-Pi1-CA0]]","[[62-df-Tree]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma VI.1.1","source_pages":[217,218],"source_pdf_pages":[235,236]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pi11-CA0-equivalences — Pi-One-One Comprehension and Tree Path Index Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d\" href=\"?note=2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d\" title=\"62-df-Pi1-CA0\">62-df-Pi1-CA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma VI.1.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>235</span><span>236</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d\" href=\"?note=2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d\" title=\"62-df-Pi1-CA0\">62-df-Pi1-CA0</a>；Tree、Path 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a>；截面见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WFI}\">\\(\\mathrm{WFI}\\)</span> 在下式引入。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> 是局部导出名；其限定名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}_{\\mathrm{path}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}_{\\mathrm{path}}\\)</span>。引用本文件导入的是路径指标原则，不与理想存在原则的同形局部名识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pi11\\text{-}CA0\\text{-}equivalences}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PI}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall C[\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Tree}((C)_i)\\to\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))],\\\\\n\\mathrm{WFI}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall C[\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Tree}((C)_i)\\to\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pi11\\text{-}CA0\\text{-}equivalences}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PI}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall C[\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Tree}((C)_i)\\to\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))],\\\\\n\\mathrm{WFI}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall C[\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Tree}((C)_i)\\to\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{PI}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{WFI}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{PI}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{WFI}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}_{\\mathrm{path}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PI}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PI}_{\\mathrm{path}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PI}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>VI.1.1：正向由 Π¹₁ 理解形成无路径指标，取补集得路径指标。反向先用检查一个函数未取到 i 的恒零路径树恢复 ACA₀；此后 V.1.4 的正规形将每个 Σ¹₁ 条件转成一棵自然数树的路径存在，PI 形成其指标集，取补得 Π¹₁ 理解。正规形这一步在已恢复 ACA₀ 后进行，没有在 RCA₀ 中偷用算术理解。WFI 在此指树无路径，不是未编码的外部良基性；不限制为二叉树。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Lemma VI.1.1；纸面页 217, 218；PDF 页 235, 236。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Pi1-CA0","status":"resolved","id":"2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Pi1-CA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-Pi1-CA0]]；Tree、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；截面见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{PI}$、$\\mathrm{WFI}$ 在下式引入。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Pi1-CA0","status":"resolved","id":"2d44fbf8bf7ebe4d","anchor":"ref-7","